# region Generated files and local tooling
# Keep build output, downloaded wrapper binaries and personal IDE settings out
# of commits. HELP.md is the generated Spring starter help document. A leading
# exclamation mark re-includes matching source directories that happen to be
# named target or build; ordinary build output remains ignored.
# Ignore rules affect untracked files, not files already tracked by Git.
# endregion
HELP.md
target/
.mvn/wrapper/maven-wrapper.jar
!**/src/main/**/target/
!**/src/test/**/target/

